{
  "id" : "qeq7-f3ir",
  "name" : "Weekly Cumulative RSV Vaccination Coverage and Intent, Overall, by Selected Demographics and Jurisdiction, Among Adults 75 and Older and 50-74 Years with High-Risk Conditions Ever Vaccinated, United States",
